&gt; We're hiring safety researchers at <https://x.com/thinkymachines|@thinkymachines>! 
&gt; 
&gt; My team works on safety across the model development stack -- pre-training data filtering, harmful capability evals, safety post-training, red-teaming, abliteration/malicious fine-tuning.
&gt; 
&gt; We're particularly interested in building evals and tooling to make strong safety cases for open-weights releases. We think this is where some of the most important safety research will happen in the next few years.
&gt; 
&gt; If any of this resonates, apply <https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/ThinkingMachines/01aba71c-b55f-4df5-b803-dc545e6a9434|here>

